<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχελίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, mostly in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχελίδες</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ribs of
				beef</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				443
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				362
			</span></i> (cf. Sch.ad loc., <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				253
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὁλόκνημοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					108.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπρου σχελίδες</span> cj.
			Mein. in <i><span class="en">
				Archipp.
				11.3
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. λαγωῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					6.33
				</span></i>
			:—later written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκελίδες</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑῶν</span>
			<i>sides</i> of bacon, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				7.44
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.428.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, and so prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.193
			</span></i>.</div>
